{"game": "alien-swarm", "language": "english", "appid": 630, "month": "2016-07", "window": 2, "start_date": 1467936000, "end_date": 1468627199, "month_true_total": 144, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-06 01:00:35 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "24343528", "author": {"steamid": "76561198038276001", "personaname": "Lix", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/TheDeLiXx/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 27, "playtime_forever": 212, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 107, "last_played": 1468848595, "avatar": "41d05794ba89fd2d1b34ab893a91648c4da1b8f7"}, "language": "english", "review": "I wouldn't have minded paying a little on this game. It looks decent, runs smoothly and is just generally fun to play with some friends. The difficulty \"normal\" was just right for 2player coop (on 3-4 it could've possibly been too easy, but who knows, I don't). You actually quite often engage situations where accessories finds its use, not like in certain other games where in the first few tutorial lvls you're being taught fancy game mechanics, that you'll only need once or twice throughout the entire game. Low ammo and health quickly turn into a well placed problem, forcing you to find the perfect balance between close combat, slalom running and spraying.\nThe game reminds me of the old clonk stippel maps, which brings back quite a lot of nostalgia, but don't be fooled by that:\nTell your friends to download the game and try it for yourselves", "timestamp_created": 1468625511, "timestamp_updated": 1468625511, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "24340132", "author": {"steamid": "76561198126045274", "personaname": "Snarg", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198126045274/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 507, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 458, "last_played": 1503442850, "avatar": "6b53b059da69210094f1379cccb5a47b2959b4bf"}, "language": "english", "review": "At some point I hope to go into computer programing and modify the games code to add more stuffs, also it's a good game but it's a d**m shame it doesnt have a sequal because I would pay for that (not too much $10-$30 deping on how expansive it is).  Oh yeah this is a game review! Almost forgot to say to play it with friends (or with stangers who you call friends). Also medics can heal you enough to where you can survive a face \"hugger\". Also the few downsides are the 5-10 minutes it takes to downlad and the time it takes to type one of these.\n", "timestamp_created": 1468611764, "timestamp_updated": 1468611764, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "24335791", "author": {"steamid": "76561198126288002", "personaname": "BlackSlime_", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/BlackSlime_/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 37, "playtime_forever": 3051, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2644, "last_played": 1487016661, "avatar": "f9b0cb1ebbf1096683e01832b371d2997038ea4f"}, "language": "english", "review": "well it's not best game ever but it's free", "timestamp_created": 1468596332, "timestamp_updated": 1468596332, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.47413790225982666", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_a